1
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,640
[EP13]

2
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:41,620
I'll save her.

3
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:49,780
You don't deserve to be a doctor.

4
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,100
It's you who killed my family.

5
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,200
[I can't let fear]

6
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,980
[stop me from saving lives.]

7
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:10,500
Wanwan,

8
00:01:12,720 --> 00:01:13,720
I've got the car ready.

9
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,260
In five minutes,

10
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,160
take Second Aunt

11
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:16,980
and leave through the back door.

12
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,320
She won't make it to the hospital.

13
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:21,080
Even if she does,

14
00:01:21,320 --> 00:01:22,340
with the current medical equipment,

15
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,360
she won't survive.

16
00:01:23,940 --> 00:01:24,760
Go pack your clothes.

17
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:25,980
Do you trust me?

18
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:27,020
I do.

19
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,160
But you know Grandma.

20
00:01:29,620 --> 00:01:30,580
With her temper,

21
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:31,560
she won't do anything

22
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:32,700
to me,

23
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:34,200
But for you...

24
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,080
I'm your wife,

25
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,500
and the Ling family's wife.

26
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:39,420
Don't be afraid.

27
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:41,360
I'm here for you.

28
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:42,820
Do what you want to do.

29
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:04,160
This is the scent on Zhaoyue.

30
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,420
Could it be that the Second Madame killed Zhaoyue?

31
00:02:10,540 --> 00:02:11,640
But I have no evidence.

32
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,540
There are thousands of perfumes in the world.

33
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,380
What if it's just a coincidence?

34
00:02:15,820 --> 00:02:16,920
Better to kill a thousand by mistake

35
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,080
than let one slip away.

36
00:02:18,620 --> 00:02:20,020
What if it really is the Second Concubine?

37
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:23,060
Medical conditions in the Republic of China were poor.

38
00:02:23,180 --> 00:02:25,280
It's common for two lives to be in one body.

39
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:27,260
Save me.

40
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,820
Save me.

41
00:02:33,340 --> 00:02:35,940
Save my child.

42
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,940
I can't let anyone die in front of me.

43
00:03:13,940 --> 00:03:15,280
She's given birth.

44
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:18,240
Really?

45
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,320
A boy

46
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:32,480
or

47
00:03:33,140 --> 00:03:34,260
a girl?

48
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,440
A boy.

49
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:09,440
Second Madame and the baby are fine.

50
00:04:10,540 --> 00:04:12,200
I'll prescribe some tonic medicine.

51
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,160
She'll be cured after a few days of recuperation.

52
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:17,740
But

53
00:04:18,220 --> 00:04:19,620
the baby was born

54
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:20,960
with cyanotic lips.

55
00:04:21,860 --> 00:04:22,840
I'm afraid he has asthma.

56
00:04:24,220 --> 00:04:24,960
This disease

57
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,280
is most afraid of noise and fatigue.

58
00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:29,380
It's best to lie down and rest often.

59
00:04:29,380 --> 00:04:30,140
Avoid

60
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:33,140
getting angry, overexertion, and excessive exercise.

61
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:06,080
As long as you are willing to put this medicine

62
00:05:06,080 --> 00:05:07,660
into your master's food,

63
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,300
not only will this money be yours,

64
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:11,180
but I will also give you a large sum of money later.

65
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:13,560
Think about your sick mother without money for treatment.

66
00:05:13,580 --> 00:05:15,880
I don't need to tell you what to do, right?

67
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:20,640
Young Madam, don't blame me for being cruel.

68
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:33,740
Brother,

69
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,120
why are you here?

70
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:36,640
Don't move.

71
00:05:41,980 --> 00:05:43,200
Your poison has not been detoxified.

72
00:05:47,460 --> 00:05:48,960
I've been very careful.

73
00:05:50,620 --> 00:05:52,120
The maids are all from the Su family.

74
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,620
Could it be

75
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,480
they have bribed the maids from the Su family?

76
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:03,520
Young Madam,

77
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:05,620
here are some snacks from the kitchen.

78
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:07,580
Give them to me.

79
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:16,480
The Sus are not what they used to be.

80
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,380
It's normal for me to be disloyal.

81
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,640
Although the poison hasn't been detoxified,

82
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,880
it won't be life-threatening.

83
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:23,660
I'm going to leave Yang City for a while

84
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,540
to find the antidote.

85
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:26,320
Be careful.

86
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:28,760
Brother, stop talking about me.

87
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:29,840
How are you doing?

88
00:06:30,020 --> 00:06:30,920
Did you find anything?

89
00:06:31,320 --> 00:06:32,660
Any progress recently?

90
00:06:32,820 --> 00:06:34,620
Mother and Moon often go to

91
00:06:35,320 --> 00:06:36,520
the orphanage

92
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:37,660
besides the Su's business.

93
00:06:39,180 --> 00:06:40,360
I've been to the orphanage to investigate,

94
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:42,800
but the children there cried when they saw me.

95
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,920
I couldn't get any information.

96
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:46,480
Forget it. I'll go to the orphanage tomorrow.

97
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:49,560
I've heard Deputy Li say that

98
00:06:49,980 --> 00:06:51,520
the little stable boy

99
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:52,560
who accidentally broke into the team

100
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,380
on the day when the Marshal got killed

101
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:54,640
was from this orphanage.

102
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:57,720
Who are you?

103
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,380
What are you doing here?

104
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:05,100
I'm Su Muwan, the daughter of the Su family.

105
00:07:05,580 --> 00:07:07,120
You're Mrs. Ling,

106
00:07:08,020 --> 00:07:09,180
the wife of the Young Marshal.

107
00:07:09,180 --> 00:07:10,800
You're so pretty.

108
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:14,560
Young Madam, we are all orphans who have escaped from the war.

109
00:07:14,660 --> 00:07:17,800
We were refused by other places.

110
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:18,960
It's the Marshal and the Young Marshal

111
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:20,860
who gave us such a beautiful house.

112
00:07:22,220 --> 00:07:25,140
You can tell me whatever you want to eat.

113
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:26,400
I'll buy it for you.

114
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:28,500
- Great. - Great.

115
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:29,060
Great.

116
00:07:29,940 --> 00:07:33,200
Nanfeng, tell me whatever you want.

117
00:07:33,580 --> 00:07:34,480
I'll buy it for you.

118
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,680
Really? That's great!

119
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:42,700
Young Master,

120
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,820
we've cut off all herbal medicine sales,

121
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,160
leaving only Hongji Hall.

122
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:47,600
You mentioned burning down this orphanage.

123
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:48,260
Orphanage?

124
00:07:49,540 --> 00:07:50,320
Leave it be.

125
00:07:51,460 --> 00:07:52,020
By the way,

126
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:53,620
do you know a child named

127
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:55,020
Abao?

128
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:57,620
Abao...

129
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,340
He...

130
00:07:58,500 --> 00:07:59,140
What happened to him?

131
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:00,820
He got into a car accident.

132
00:08:01,100 --> 00:08:02,800
He's still in a coma.

133
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,220
How did this happen all of a sudden?

134
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:04,920
No,

135
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:05,920
I have to go see him.

136
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:07,360
This way,

137
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,440
he's right there.

138
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,740
The doctor said Abao might wake up tomorrow,

139
00:08:15,780 --> 00:08:18,020
or never.

140
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:22,280
[The car accident is so strange.]

141
00:08:22,740 --> 00:08:24,540
[It seems to be related to the death of the Old Marshal.]

142
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,740
[Did she see something?]

143
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:34,660
[She's just a stable boy.]

144
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:36,700
[How could she have such a delicate handkerchief?]

145
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:39,440
[Could it be left by the murderer by accident?]

146
00:08:42,820 --> 00:08:44,340
[This handkerchief is very distinctive.]

147
00:08:44,740 --> 00:08:46,340
[It can't be owned by ordinary people.]

148
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:50,140
[Chu Nanfeng is surrounded by women all year round.]

149
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:51,460
[Maybe]

150
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,880
he knows who the owner is.

151
00:09:17,660 --> 00:09:19,340
Last time it was because of Ling Shenxing.

152
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,720
What's the reason this time?

153
00:09:21,100 --> 00:09:21,780
Xiao Wan,

154
00:09:22,260 --> 00:09:25,100
can't you just ask me out because you want to see me?

155
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:26,700
When I have something,

156
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,540
you're the first one I think of.

157
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,720
Isn't that enough?

158
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,940
But I never do anything for nothing,

159
00:09:38,420 --> 00:09:40,620
and I don't want you to see me because of someone else.

160
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,360
Then let's stick to the old rules.

161
00:09:42,800 --> 00:09:44,120
I'll give you my time.

162
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:49,940
Please.
